{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hos-2-1","title":"Hosea 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The idolatry of the people. 6 God's judgments against them. 14 His promises of reconciliation with them.</p>\n<p>unto. 1:9-11 Ammi. That is, My people. Ex 19:5,6; Jer 31:33; 32:38; Eze 11:20; 36:28; 37:27; Zec 13:9 Ruhamah. That is, Having obtained mercy. 23; Ro 11:30,31; 2Co 4:1; 1Ti 1:13; 1Pe 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-2","title":"Hosea 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Plead with. Isa 58:1; Jer 2:2; 19:3; Eze 20:4; 23:45; Mt 23:37-39; Ac 7:51-53 2Co 5:16 she. Isa 50:1; Jer 3:6-8 let. 1:2; Jer 3:1,9,13; Eze 16:20,25; 23:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-3","title":"Hosea 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I strip. 10; Isa 47:3; Jer 13:22,26; Eze 16:37-39; 23:26-29; Re 17:16 was born. Eze 16:4-8,22 as. Isa 32:13,14; 33:9; 64:10; Jer 2:31; 4:26; 12:10; 22:6; Eze 19:13 Eze 20:35,36 a dry. Jer 2:6; 17:6; 51:43 and slay. Ex 17:3; Jud 15:18; Am 8:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-4","title":"Hosea 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I will not. 1:6; Isa 27:11; Jer 13:14; 16:5; Eze 8:18; 9:10; Zec 1:12; Ro 9:18 Ro 11:22; Jas 2:13 they be.They are all idolaters; and have been consecrated to idols, whose marks they bear.</p>\n<p>children of. 1:2; 2Ki 9:22; Isa 57:3; Joh 8:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-5","title":"Hosea 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>their mother. 2; 3:1; 4:5,12-15; Isa 1:21; 50:1; Jer 2:20,25; 3:1-9; Eze 16:15,16 Eze 16:28-34; 23:5-11; Re 2:20-23; 17:1-5 hath done. 9:10; Ezr 9:6,7; Jer 2:26,27; 11:13; Da 9:5-8 I will. 13; 8:9; Isa 57:7,8; Jer 3:1-3; Eze 23:16,17,40-44 give. 8,12; Jud 16:23; Jer 44:17,18 drink. Heb. drinks.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-6","title":"Hosea 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will. Job 3:23; 19:8; La 3:7-9; Lu 15:14-16; 19:43 make a wall. Heb. wall a wall.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-7","title":"Hosea 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>she shall follow. 5:13; 2Ch 28:20-22; Isa 30:2,3,16; 31:1-3; Jer 2:28,36,37; 30:12-15 Eze 20:32; 23:22 I will. 5:15; 6:1; 14:1; Ps 116:7; Jer 3:22-25; 31:18; 50:4,5; La 3:40-42 Lu 15:17-20 first. Jer 2:2; 3:1; 31:32; Eze 16:18; 23:4 for. 13:6; De 6:10-12; 8:17,18; 32:13-15; Ne 9:25,26; Jer 14:22 Da 4:17,25,32; 5:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-8","title":"Hosea 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>she. Isa 1:3; Hab 1:16; Ac 17:23-25; Ro 1:28 her corn. 5; 10:1; Jud 9:27; Jer 7:18; 44:17,18; Eze 16:16-19; Da 5:3,4,23 Lu 15:13; 16:1,2 wine. Heb. new wine. 4:11; Isa 24:7-9 which they prepared for Baal. or, wherewith they made Baal. 8:4; 13:2; Ex 32:2-4; Jud 17:1-5; Isa 46:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-9","title":"Hosea 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>will I. Da 11:13; Joe 2:14; Mal 1:4; 3:18 take. 3; Isa 3:18-26; 17:10,11; Eze 16:27,39; 23:26; Zep 1:13; Hag 1:6-11 Hag 2:16,17 recover. or, take away.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-10","title":"Hosea 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>now. 3; Isa 3:17; Jer 13:22,26; Eze 16:36; 23:29; Lu 12:2,3; 1Co 4:5 lewdness. Heb. folly, or, villany. and none shall. 5:13,14; 13:7,8; Ps 50:22; Pr 11:21; Mic 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-11","title":"Hosea 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>cause. 9:1-5; Isa 24:7-11; Jer 7:34; 16:9; 25:10; Eze 26:13; Na 1:10 Re 18:22,23 her feast. 1Ki 12:32; Isa 1:13,14; Am 5:21; 8:3,5,9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-12","title":"Hosea 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>destroy. Heb. make desolate. These. 5; 9:1 I will. Ps 80:12; Isa 5:5; 7:23; 29:17; 32:13-15; Jer 26:18; Mic 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-13","title":"Hosea 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will visit. 9:7,9; Ex 32:34; Jer 23:2 the days. 9:10; 13:1; Jud 2:11-13; 3:7; 10:6; 1Ki 16:31,32; 18:18-40; 2Ki 1:2 2Ki 10:28; 21:3 she burned. 11:2; Jer 7:9; 11:13; 18:15 she decked. Eze 23:40-42 she went. 5,7; Jer 2:23-25 forgat. De 6:12; 8:11-14; 32:18; Jud 3:7; 1Sa 12:9; Job 8:13; Ps 78:11 Ps 106:13,21; Isa 17:10; Jer 2:32; Eze 22:12; 23:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-14","title":"Hosea 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Therefore. Isa 30:18; Jer 16:14 I will. So 1:4; Joh 6:44; 12:32 and bring. 3; Jer 2:2; Eze 20:10,35,36; Re 12:6,14 and speak. Isa 35:3,4; 40:1,2; 49:13-26; 51:3-23; Jer 3:12-24; 30:18-22 Jer 31:1-37; 32:36-41; 33:6-26; Eze 34:22-31; 36:8-15; 37:11-28 Eze 39:25-29; Am 9:11-15; Mic 7:14-20; Zep 3:9-20; Zec 1:12-17 Zec 8:19-23; Ro 11:26,27 comfortably. or, friendly. Heb. to her heart. Ge 34:3; Jud 19:3; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-15","title":"Hosea 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will. 12; Le 26:40-45; De 30:3-5; Ne 1:8,9; Isa 65:21; Jer 32:15 Eze 28:26; Am 9:14 the valley. Jos 7:26; Isa 65:10 for. La 3:21; Eze 37:11-14; Zec 9:12; Joh 10:9; Ac 14:27 she shall sing. Ex 15:1-21; Nu 21:17; Ps 106:12 as in the days. 11:1; Jer 2:2; Eze 16:8,22,60</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-16","title":"Hosea 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Ishi. that is, My husband. 7; Isa 54:5; Jer 3:14; Joh 3:29; 2Co 11:2; Eph 5:25-27; Re 19:7 Baali. that is, My lord.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-17","title":"Hosea 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I will. Ex 23:13; Jos 23:7; Ps 16:4; Zec 13:2 and they. Jer 10:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-18","title":"Hosea 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>in that day. Isa 2:11,17; 26:1; Zec 2:11; 14:4,9 will I. Job 5:23; Ps 91:1-13; Isa 11:6-9; 65:25; Eze 34:25 I will break. Ps 46:9; Isa 2:4; Eze 39:9,10; Mic 4:3; Zec 9:10 and will. Le 26:5,6; Ps 23:2; Jer 23:6; 30:10; 33:16; Eze 34:25; Mic 4:4 Zec 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-19","title":"Hosea 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>And I will. Isa 54:5; 62:3-5; Jer 3:14,15; Joh 3:29; Ro 7:4; 2Co 11:2 Eph 5:25-27; Re 19:7-9; 21:2,9,10 for. Isa 54:8-10; Jer 31:31-36; 32:38-41; Eze 37:25-28; 39:29; Joe 3:20 in righteousness. Ps 85:10; Isa 45:23-25; 54:14; Jer 4:2; Ro 3:25-26; Eph 1:7,8 Eph 5:23-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-20","title":"Hosea 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>and. Jer 9:24; 24:7; 31:33,34; Eze 38:23; Mt 11:27; Lu 10:22; Joh 8:55 Joh 17:3; 2Co 4:6; Php 3:8; Col 1:10; 2Ti 1:12; Heb 8:11; 1Jo 4:6 1Jo 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-21","title":"Hosea 2:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>I will hear, saith. Isa 65:24; Zec 8:12; 13:9; Mt 6:33; Ro 8:32; 1Co 3:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-22","title":"Hosea 2:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>and they. 1:4,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-2-23","title":"Hosea 2:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>I will sow. Ps 72:16; Jer 31:27; Zec 10:9; Ac 8:1-4; Jas 1:1; 1Pe 1:1,2 and I will have. 1:6; Ro 11:30-32; 1Pe 2:9,10 and I will say. 1:10; Zec 2:11; 13:9; Ro 9:25,26 Thou art my God. 8:2; De 26:17-19; Ps 22:27; 68:31; 118:28; So 2:16; Isa 44:5 Jer 16:19; 32:38; Zec 8:22,23; 14:9,16; Mal 1:11; Ro 3:29; 15:9-11 1Th 1:9,10; Re 21:3,4</p>"}]}